  doc=dispatchConstructRender is the ACTIVE-tier handler: it maps the model's\nconstruct_render arguments onto a validated Construct surface and emits it.\nA validation error is returned in-band (isError=true, err=nil) so the model\nreads it and corrects the call rather than the harness retrying.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/neo/internal/tools.Manager
  ^defines=matrix/neo/internal/tools/tools.go

