NODE id=matrix/neo/internal/tools.asTime kind=func
  digest=b3:1752255b9681153e80e1da0fd5deeaaa7d9645becefc3de0ea9a6906c16b9100 file=neo/internal/tools/tools.go range=678:693 lang=go exported=false byte_range=26285:26780
  sig=func asTime(v interface{}) *time.Time
  doc=asTime parses an ISO-8601 / RFC3339 (or bare YYYY-MM-DD) string argument into\na UTC instant for bi-temporal as-of queries (v3 #2). Returns nil for a\nmissing or unparseable value (the caller then reads against "now").
